# pyenv
#   For a library or app, you might want to share your .python-version.
#   See https://github.com/pyenv/pyenv/issues/530
#.python-version

# pipenv
#   According to Pipfile.lock spec, it should be committed.
#   Only uncomment if you have reasons to ignore it.
#Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   poetry.lock is usually committed.
#   Only uncomment if you have reasons to ignore it.
#poetry.lock

# pdm
#   pdm.lock is usually committed.
#   Only uncomment if you have reasons to ignore it.
#.pdm.toml
#.pdm-python
#.pdm-build/

# PEP 582; used by e.g. github.com/lincolnloop/layman and github.com/pdm-project/pdm
